{
  "_readme": "Copy to tokens.json during setup and replace values with the client's style guide. Use 6-digit hex colors only (#rrggbb): Mermaid's theme engine cannot derive colors from rgba() or named colors. Run `node diagrams/scripts/generate.mjs` after every change.",
